        </li>
        <li>
          <b className="k-blue">💧</b> A blue blob is scooting away. Under leaves it is harder to spot.
        </li>
        <li>
          <b className="k-gold">✦</b> A boop: the red glows and rests, and the blue loses energy.
        </li>
        <li>
